{"sha": "3d5a2c6ebd6b17e2dff6c6d64a9e4f3162b73a515c88c66e3119d64787ed3989", "body": ["{\\small 由 $pK_a$ 值算得的分布图。左：", "乙酸，两曲线在 4.76 处相交。右：甘氨酸，", "\\ce{H2N-CH2-COOH}，有两个共轭对（$pK_a$ 为 2.35 和 9.78）：阳离子", "\\ce{H3N+-CH2-COOH}、两性离子 \\ce{H3N+-CH2-COO-} 和阴离子", "\\ce{H2N-CH2-COO-}。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[甘氨酸在人体内]\\label{ex:g12:buffers-predominance:glycine}", "% ledger: pka:glycine1, pka:glycine2, ph:blood", "血液的 pH 约为 7.4，此时甘氨酸处于其两个 $pK_a$", "值之间：它几乎全部以两性离子形式存在，带", "正电荷的是氮原子，带负电荷的是羧酸根，", "整体呈电中性。每种氨基酸都是如此。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{酸碱指示剂}", "", "", "\\begin{definition}[酸碱指示剂、变色范围]\\label{def:g12:buffers-predominance:indicator}", "\\emph{酸碱指示剂}\\index{酸碱指示剂}是一个酸碱共轭对", "\\ce{HInd}/\\ce{Ind-}，其两种形式颜色不同，用量很少。", "其\\emph{变色范围}\\index{变色范围}", "为颜色可见发生变化的 pH 区间，大致为", "$pK_a - 1$ 至 $pK_a + 1$：pH 低于此值时看到 \\ce{HInd} 的颜色，高于此值时", "看到 \\ce{Ind-} 的颜色，两者之间则为二者的混合色。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=0.62cm]", "  % ledger: ind:methyl-red, ind:BBT, ind:phenolphthalein, ind:thymol-blue, ind:range-rule", "  \\foreach \\y/\\name/\\a/\\b/\\ca/\\cm/\\cb in {", "      0/{methyl red}/4.2/6.3/red!70/orange/yellow!80,", "      -0.8/{bromothymol blue}/6.0/7.6/yellow!80/green!60/blue!60,", "      -1.6/{phenolphthalein}/8.0/10.0/white/magenta!25/magenta!70} {", "    \\fill[\\ca] (0,\\y) rectangle (\\a,\\y+0.5);", "    \\shade[left color=\\ca, right color=\\cb] (\\a,\\y) rectangle (\\b,\\y+0.5);", "    \\fill[\\cb] (\\b,\\y) rectangle (14,\\y+0.5);", "    \\draw[black!50] (0,\\y) rectangle (14,\\y+0.5);", "    \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.2,\\y+0.25) {\\name};", "  }", "  \\fill[red!65] (0,-2.4) rectangle (1.2,-1.9);", "  \\shade[left color=red!65, right color=yellow!80] (1.2,-2.4) rectangle (2.8,-1.9);", "  \\fill[yellow!80] (2.8,-2.4) rectangle (8.0,-1.9);", "  \\shade[left color=yellow!80, right color=blue!60] (8.0,-2.4) rectangle (9.1,-1.9);", "  \\fill[blue!60] (9.1,-2.4) rectangle (14,-1.9);", "  \\draw[black!50] (0,-2.4) rectangle (14,-1.9);", "  \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.2,-2.15) {百里酚蓝};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-2.8) -- (14.5,-2.8) node[right] {pH};", "  \\foreach \\k in {0,2,4,6,8,10,12,14} \\draw (\\k,-2.75) -- (\\k,-2.85) node[below, font=\\scriptsize] {\\k};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 四种指示剂的颜色随 pH 变化的情况如图，阴影部分为", "变色范围。百里酚蓝含两个共轭对，因此有两个", "变色范围。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[选择指示剂]\\label{met:g12:buffers-predominance:indicator}", "要检测溶液何时到达某一给定 pH（例如滴定的终点 pH），", "应选择变色范围包含该 pH 的指示剂，", "此时颜色恰好在该处发生变化。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{缓冲溶液}", "", "\\begin{definition}[缓冲溶液]\\label{def:g12:buffers-predominance:buffer}", "\\emph{缓冲溶液}\\index{缓冲溶液}是一种溶液，其 pH", "在加入少量酸或碱时，或被稀释时变化很小。", "通常由弱酸及其共轭碱按", "相近的量配制，此时其 pH 接近该共轭对的 $pK_a$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[缓冲溶液为何能抵抗变化]\\label{prop:g12:buffers-predominance:buffer}", "在由 \\ce{HA} 和 \\ce{A-} 组成的缓冲溶液中，加入的强酸被 \\ce{A-}", "消耗（\\ce{A- + H3O+ -> HA + H2O}），加入的强碱则被 \\ce{HA}", "消耗（\\ce{HA + OH- -> A- + H2O}）；比值 $[\\ce{A-}]/[\\ce{HA}]$ 因而", "pH 只发生很小的变化。稀释根本不改变该比值。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由亨德森方程可知，pH 仅取决于该比值。向", "两种形式各含 \\qty{10}{mmol} 的缓冲溶液中加入 \\qty{1}{mmol} 酸，", "比值由 $10/10$ 变为 $9/11$，pH 的变化量", "仅为 $\\log(9/11) = -0.09$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.75\\linewidth, height=5.6cm, xmin=0, xmax=10, ymin=0,", "    ymax=8, xlabel={加入 \\ce{HCl}（\\qty{0.10}{mol/L}）的体积（\\si{mL}）},", "    ylabel={pH}, axis lines*=left, ymajorgrids, grid style={gray!20},", "    tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small},", "    legend style={font=\\small, at={(0.98,0.97)}, anchor=north east,", "    draw=none, fill=white}, legend cell align=left]", "  % ledger: pka:ethanoic (buffer recipe: exercise data)", "  \\addplot[very thick, omThm, mark=*, mark size=1.3pt] table[x=V, y=water]", "    {figdata/out/grade-12-buffers-predominance-c.dat};", "  \\addplot[very thick, omDef, mark=*, mark size=1.3pt] table[x=V, y=buffer]", "    {figdata/out/grade-12-buffers-predominance-c.dat};", "  \\legend{\\qty{100}{mL} 纯水，\\qty{100}{mL} 乙酸盐缓冲溶液}", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 向纯水及由乙酸和乙酸钠组成的缓冲溶液中分别加入盐酸，", "（各 \\qty{0.10}{mol/L}）。纯水的 pH", "由 7 降至约 2，缓冲溶液的 pH 则由 4.76 降至 4.67。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[配制缓冲溶液]\\label{met:g12:buffers-predominance:prepare}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 选择一个 $pK_a$ 与所需 pH 相差不超过一个单位的共轭对，", "        （最好尽量接近）。", "  \\item 计算比值 $[\\ce{A-}]/[\\ce{HA}] = 10^{\\mathrm{pH} - pK_a}$。", "  \\item 按该比值将弱酸与其碱的盐混合，", "        浓度要足够高，使所加入的", "        酸或碱能被吸收。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", ""]}